  "description": "(Listed building consent also submitted ref:P2024/2702/LBC\r\n\r\nSubdivision of existing house to create a single one bed flat in the basement. \r\n\r\nThe proposal includes the re-use of the basement level of 5, Mylne St. House, as an 1 bed flat for two people. The apartment layout comprises of one bedroom, a bathroom, storage space, kitchen, and an open plan living room-dinning space. Additionally, the proposed plan includes a direct rear opening that leads to the private garden, serving as a visual treat and a direct access to the outdoor space. The scale and the purpose of the proposal do not affect the character and the heritage assets of the building."
